Purchase a license?  That's funny.  Nethack is open source, covered
by, of all things, the nethack general public license (found in
dat/license of a source distribution).  The only restrictions to
redistribution are that you distribute a copy of the original license.
 The restrictions to redistributing modifications include prominent
notice of who/when mods were made (ie, credit/blame yourself); grant a
license to your modifications that is no more restrictive than the
NGPL; provide source code with any binary distributions, or include a
prominent notice regarding how to obtain the source code.

In other words, here's nethack.  Don't remove our copyright
notifications, take credit/blame for any changes, and give away
sources/binaries to others just as we (the Dev Team) gave away our
work in the first place...

Have fun with the java port.  Let us know when you're done!
